  "prefLabel": "He-E 806.34 Medicare Provider Reimbursement Manual",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-E 806.34 Medicare Provider Reimbursement Manual. Decisions governing the allowability of costs not specifically detailed at He-E 806 shall be pursuant to the “Medicare Provider Reimbursement Manual”, Part I, HCFA-Pub 15-1 and Part II, HCFA-Pub 15-2 in effect at the time of such determination.\n\nSource. #8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.34); ss by #10474, 1-24-14; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24",
